guide butler-routes-completionist/riverglades
title Riverglades - Completionist
levels 36-45
zone Riverglades
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

# The Glades are done in passes: Farholde Keep first (the command hub),
# then the western Twilight front (Dalton farm, Riftan, the coast),
# the central farms (Turner, Cornelius, Wheeler, Holmsby, Claire),
# Powderfuse Port and the Eastsea coast in the east, the northern
# ogres, and the expedition legs for the chains that leave the zone.
# Krom'rosh and the Horde chains are not routed here - the Horde
# block owns them. Per-line `only Alliance` gates mark the Alliance-only
# lines (the records' races mask is Horde/Alliance by faction); the
# shared lines stay open to both factions.

step Farholde Keep - arrival

  accept 94613 only Alliance -- My Kingdom for a Horse - Demar Brant; Benjy Wheeler takes it west
  accept 94877 only Alliance -- Saving Sunnyglade - Demar Brant; Twilight raiders, west
  accept 94879 only Alliance -- Scraps of Knowledge - Ashe Amberhall; Twilight pages, west
  note 94879's pages have no placed source in the data - gather five off the Twilight at the west camp below.
  accept 94881 only Alliance -- Curious Trinkets - Ashe Amberhall; Twilight charms, west
  note 94907's pre (94881 above) fills at the first return - take it there.
  accept 94926 only Alliance -- Drop the Hammer - Demar Brant; Komuk's warmaul, central
  note 94926 names no giver in the data - Demar offers it at the Keep.
  accept 94982 only Alliance -- Eye of Mugg - Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall; the Eye, farmed with the pages below
  note Overlord Mugg has no spawn in the data - have his Eye in your bags.

step Farholde Keep - the town

  accept 95603 only Alliance -- Bats in the Belfry - Sister Rowland; roosting duskbats, the chapel yard
  note 95613's pre (95603 above) fills in the chapel below - take it there with Rowland.
  note 95913's pre (95561 below) fills at the first return - take it there with Tessa.
  accept 95156 only Alliance -- Stuff 'Em and Stick 'Em - Ember Bladewhisper; hay bales, the stables
  note 95156's hay has no placed source in the data - gather it and have three bundles in your bags.
  complete 95156 only Alliance
  note 95184's pre (95156 above) fills in the close below - take it there with Ember.
  accept 95943 only Alliance -- Foreman's Plight - Bertrand Ironbrow; his crate, the worksite
  note 96009's pre (95943 above) fills in the close below - take it there with Bertrand.
  note 95943's crate has no placed source in the data - work the site and have it in your bags.
  complete 95943 only Alliance
  accept 95912 only Alliance -- WANTED: Blademaster Kaijo - the wanted board; Kaijo's banner, central
  accept 95991 only Alliance -- WANTED: Ghostmaw - the wanted board; Ghostmaw's fang, central

